# ZhiXu pad posing as a wired Xbox 360 controller (045e:028e). It drops off USB
# ~350 ms after the host stops polling it, and xpad polls only while the event
# node is open, so zhixu-pad@.service holds the node open.
# Applied on every non-remove event: a change event that lost the systemd tag
# would stop the service through BindsTo=.
ACTION!="remove", SUBSYSTEM=="input", KERNEL=="event*", ATTRS{idVendor}=="045e", ATTRS{idProduct}=="028e", ATTRS{manufacturer}=="ZhiXu", TAG+="systemd", ENV{SYSTEMD_WANTS}+="zhixu-pad@%k.service"
